Subject: Update Jackson 2.22.0 to 2.22.1 for CVE remediation
Origin: DHI-internal CVE remediation
Reference: https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/com/fasterxml/jackson/core/jackson-databind/2.22.1/
Description: Gradle 9.7.0 pins Jackson 2.22.0 through shared dependency-management
  versions. Bump the 2.22 line to 2.22.1, which fixes CVE-2026-54512,
  CVE-2026-54513, CVE-2026-54514, CVE-2026-54515, CVE-2026-59889, and
  GHSA-mhm7-754m-9p8w without crossing a major or minor Jackson version.

diff --git a/gradle/dependency-management/shared-versions.properties b/gradle/dependency-management/shared-versions.properties
index bcc16252..5e1a5ac0 100644
--- a/gradle/dependency-management/shared-versions.properties
+++ b/gradle/dependency-management/shared-versions.properties
@@ -19,7 +19,7 @@
 asm=9.9!!
 errorProne=2.50.0!!
 groovy=4.0.32!!
-jackson=2.22.0!!
+jackson=2.22.1!!
 kotlinCoroutines=1.10.2!!
 maven=3.9.5!!
 mavenResolver=1.9.16!!
